D POSITIVE FOR COVID-19 VIRUS.BAXTER INTERNATIONAL INC - SACCARO CONTINUES TO PERFORM HIS RESPONSIBILITIES FROM HOME, ALONG WITH MOST OF BAXTER'S OFFICE-BASED EMPLOYEES..BAXTER INTERNATIONAL INC - A MEMBER OF BAXTER'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS TESTED POSITIVE FOR COVID-19 AND IS RECOVERING WELL IN HOSPITAL."}{'symbol': 'BBY', 'date': '2020-03-24 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Best Buy Co Says Impact Of Covid-19 Is Expected To Adversely Affect Business & Financial Results', 'text': 'BEST BUY CO - IMPACT OF COVID-19 IS EXPECTED TO ADVERSELY AFFECT BUSINESS & FINANCIAL RESULTS - SEC FILING.BEST BUY -ALL FIELD EMPLOYEES WHOSE HOURS BEEN ELIMINATED TO BE PAID FOR 2 WEEKS AT NORMAL WAGE RATE BASED ON AVERAGE HOURS WORKED OVER LAST 10 WEEKS.'}{'symbol': 'BBY', 'date': '2020-03-24 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Best Buy Co On March 19, 2020, Drew Full Amount Of $1.25 Bln Unsecured Revolving Credit Facility', 'text': "BEST BUY CO INC - ON MARCH 19, 2020, DREW FULL AMOUNT OF $1.25 BILLION UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY.BEST BUY CO INC - INTEREST RATE FOR DRAW UNDER $1.25 BILLION FACILITY IS VARIABLE AT 7-DAY LIBOR PLUS A VARIABLE MARGIN RATE OF 1.015%.BEST BUY CO INC - PROCEEDS FROM FACILITY WILL BE INCLUDED IN CASH AND CASH EQUIVALENTS ON COMPANY'S CONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEETS.BEST BUY CO - ELECTED TO DRAW ON FACILITY TO INCREASE CASH POSITION & MAXIMIZE FLEXIBILITY IN LIGHT OF UNCERTAINTY SURROUNDING IMPACT OF COVID-19."}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2020-03-24 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Given Boeing's Plans To Close Their Washington State Factories For 14 Days, Triumph Will Evaluate Need To Furlough Employees", 'text': "TRIUMPH GROUP INC - GIVEN BOEING'S PLANS TO CLOSE THEIR WASHINGTON STATE FACTORIES FOR 14 DAYS, TRIUMPH WILL EVALUATE NEED TO FURLOUGH EMPLOYEES.TRIUMPH GROUP INC - APPROXIMATELY 250 FULL-TIME SALARIED EMPLOYEE AND 250 CONTRACTOR POSITIONS WILL BE ELIMINATED..TRIUMPH GROUP INC - WILL IMPLEMENT FURLOUGHS FOR CERTAIN SALARIED EMPLOYEES OF TWO WEEKS OVER FISCAL 2021 TO MINIM